---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { url } from '../lib/paths';

const principles = [
  { number: '01', title: 'Begin with lived experience', text: 'Personal experience can reveal a pattern worth investigating. It deserves to be heard without being presented as proof for everyone.' },
  { number: '02', title: 'Follow the documentation', text: 'Health claims should lead to research, public-health guidance, or a clearly identified expert source—with limitations visible.' },
  { number: '03', title: 'Make change practical', text: 'Information helps most when people can act on it. Our guides and country directory turn a complex topic into manageable replacements.' },
  { number: '04', title: 'Advocate for shared air', text: 'Everyone should be able to ask for fragrance-aware homes, workplaces, schools, healthcare settings, and public spaces.' },
];
---

<Layout title="About Us | The story behind CleanCare" description="CleanCare began with one family’s experience of fragrance sensitivity and a mission to share evidence, practical solutions, and support for healthier air.">
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container about-hero-grid">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">About Us</p><h1>It began with<br/><em>one family’s experience.</em></h1><p class="intro">A personal change at home became a commitment to help other people understand fragrance exposure, find trustworthy documentation, and create healthier spaces.</p></div>
      <div class="story-window" aria-hidden="true"><div class="window-sky"><span></span><i></i><i></i></div><div class="window-copy"><small>OUR BEGINNING</small><strong>Remove the scent.<br/>Notice the difference.<br/>Ask why.</strong></div></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container story-section">
    <div class="story-aside"><p class="eyebrow">The personal story</p><blockquote>“When our environment changed, our wellbeing changed too. I wanted to understand why—and help others find a clearer path.”</blockquote></div>
    <div class="story-copy">
      <p>I am a woman who became sensitive to synthetic fragrances. Over time, I also noticed similar sensitivity within my family. Products that once seemed ordinary—perfume, scented laundry products, air fresheners, candles, incense, and fragranced cleaning or personal-care products—became difficult to live around.</p>
      <p>We began removing fragranced products from our home, category by category. After making those changes, my family and I noticed a clear improvement in how we felt. That experience was meaningful and impossible for us to ignore.</p>
      <div class="experience-note"><strong>Our experience is personal.</strong><span>It does not prove that fragrance caused every symptom, and it does not predict how another person will respond. It gave us an important question to investigate—not a universal diagnosis.</span></div>
      <p>I wanted to help other people understand why synthetic fragrance can be a problem for some individuals, what published evidence actually supports, and where uncertainty remains. I also wanted to make fragrance-free living feel possible by sharing practical solutions, product alternatives, and steps that families can take without changing everything overnight.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mission-band">
    <div class="container mission-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Why CleanCare exists</p><h2>From confusion to informed choice.</h2></div><div><p>CleanCare brings three things together: an explanation of possible causes and consequences, documentation readers can check for themselves, and realistic alternatives for everyday life.</p><p>This is an educational and advocacy project—not a product company and not a substitute for medical advice. Its purpose is to make reliable information easier to understand and fragrance-free choices easier to find.</p></div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="container community-section">
    <div class="community-mark" aria-hidden="true"><span>f</span><i>Shared<br/>learning</i></div>
    <div><p class="eyebrow">A wider conversation</p><h2>Join the CleanCare Facebook community.</h2><p>We also created a Facebook community to raise awareness about fragrance exposure and to share articles, practical information, and resources about this environmental issue. Everyone is welcome to join the conversation and share scientific or journalistic work that helps others examine the topic with care.</p><p class="community-note">Community posts can raise useful questions, but they are not automatically evidence. CleanCare separates personal stories, reporting, expert commentary, and primary sources when preparing its guides.</p><p class="community-contact">Questions or resources to share? <a href="mailto:cleancare.admin@gmail.com">cleancare.admin@gmail.com</a></p></div>
    <div class="community-links"><a class="button" href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/391954731491131/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Join the Facebook group ↗</a><a class="text-link" href="https://www.facebook.com/groups/391954731491131/user/100064089994907/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit our Facebook page ↗</a><small>Facebook may require sign-in.</small></div>
  </section>

  <section class="container section values-section">
    <div class="section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">What guides us</p><h2>Experience, evidence, action.</h2></div><p>A personal story started the work. Transparent sources shape what we publish.</p></div>
    <div class="principle-grid">{principles.map(item => <article><span>{item.number}</span><h3>{item.title}</h3><p>{item.text}</p></article>)}</div>
  </section>

  <section class="container invitation"><div><p class="eyebrow">You are not alone</p><h2>Start with one change.</h2><p>If fragrance affects you or someone close to you, begin with the products designed to spread scent through the air. Then work through laundry, cleaning, and personal care at a pace that is manageable.</p></div><div class="invitation-actions"><a class="button" href={url('guides/fragrance-free-starter-toolkit/')}>Open the starter toolkit ↗</a><a class="text-link" href={url('evidence/')}>Follow the sources <span>→</span></a></div></section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .about-hero{padding:72px 0;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fbf9f6 0%,#edf4ec 58%,#e8f3f8 100%);border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)}.about-hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.12fr .88fr;gap:68px;align-items:center}.about-hero h1{margin:10px 0 22px;font-size:clamp(48px,6.3vw,82px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-.055em}.about-hero h1 em{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-weight:400;color:var(--accent-sage)}.about-hero .intro{max-width:760px}.story-window{overflow:hidden;border-radius:170px 170px 24px 24px;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 18px 50px rgba(82,110,88,.13)}.window-sky{position:relative;height:220px;background:#cfe2e8}.window-sky:after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;right:0;bottom:0;height:34px;background:#8fab8d}.window-sky span{position:absolute;top:42px;right:54px;width:74px;height:74px;border-radius:50%;background:#f6bd78}.window-sky i{position:absolute;bottom:18px;width:34px;height:82px;border-radius:100% 0;background:#6f916f}.window-sky i:nth-child(2){left:54px;transform:rotate(-30deg)}.window-sky i:nth-child(3){left:100px;transform:rotate(24deg) scale(.78)}.window-copy{padding:32px 38px 38px}.window-copy small{display:block;margin-bottom:22px;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em}.window-copy strong{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:30px;line-height:1.18;font-weight:400;color:#526e58}
  .story-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.72fr 1.28fr;gap:80px;padding-block:82px}.story-aside{position:sticky;top:30px;align-self:start}.story-aside blockquote{margin:18px 0 0;padding:0;border:0;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(27px,3vw,39px);line-height:1.28;color:#526e58}.story-copy{font-size:16px}.story-copy>p{margin:0 0 24px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--muted)}.story-copy>p:first-child::first-letter{float:left;margin:8px 8px 0 0;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:64px;line-height:.65;color:var(--accent-sage)}.experience-note{display:grid;grid-template-columns:170px 1fr;gap:20px;margin:32px 0;padding:22px;border-left:4px solid var(--accent-active);border-radius:12px;background:#fff4eb;font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}.experience-note span{color:var(--muted)}
  .mission-band{padding:68px 0;background:#293f39;color:#fff}.mission-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.82fr 1.18fr;gap:80px}.mission-band .eyebrow{color:#bcd1c4}.mission-band h2{margin:8px 0 0;font-size:clamp(36px,4.5vw,58px);line-height:1.1}.mission-grid>div:last-child{display:grid;gap:14px}.mission-grid p:not(.eyebrow){margin:0;color:#dce7e1;line-height:1.85}
  .community-section{display:grid;grid-template-columns:104px minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:34px;align-items:center;margin-block:64px;padding:32px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:24px;background:#fff}.community-mark{display:grid;place-items:center;width:94px;height:94px;border-radius:28px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e8f3f8,#e5efe3);color:#526e58}.community-mark span{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:48px;line-height:1}.community-mark i{margin-top:-8px;font-size:9px;font-style:normal;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.1em;text-align:center;text-transform:uppercase}.community-section h2{margin:6px 0 10px;font-size:clamp(25px,3vw,35px)}.community-section p:not(.eyebrow){max-width:730px;margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.75}.community-section .community-note{margin-top:10px;font-size:12px}.community-section .community-contact{margin-top:12px}.community-contact a{font-weight:700;color:#557a68}.community-links{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:flex-start;gap:12px}.community-links .button{white-space:nowrap}.community-links small{color:var(--muted);font-size:11px}
  .principle-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:18px}.principle-grid article{padding:25px;border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;background:#fff}.principle-grid span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:42px;height:42px;margin-bottom:28px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--accent-sky);color:#4f6d76;font-size:11px;font-weight:700}.principle-grid h3{margin:0 0 11px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.35}.principle-grid p{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;line-height:1.7}
  .invitation{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:40px;margin-bottom:76px;padding:42px;border-radius:24px;background:#e8f3f8}.invitation h2{margin:6px 0 10px;font-size:38px}.invitation p:last-child{max-width:740px;margin:0;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.7}.invitation-actions{display:flex;flex:none;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:18px}
  @media(max-width:950px){.about-hero-grid,.story-section,.mission-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.story-aside{position:static}.principle-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.community-section{grid-template-columns:94px 1fr}.community-links{grid-column:2}.invitation{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}.invitation-actions{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:row;flex-wrap:wrap}}
  @media(max-width:620px){.about-hero{padding:48px 0}.about-hero h1{letter-spacing:-.04em}.story-section{gap:34px;padding-block:54px}.experience-note{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:6px}.community-section{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:18px;margin-block:40px;padding:24px}.community-links{grid-column:auto}.principle-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.invitation{padding:28px}.invitation-actions{flex-direction:column}.window-copy{padding:26px}.window-copy strong{font-size:25px}}
</style>
